# Complete from the command menu while editing an Overdue entry keeps editing that block, so a typed x is text and the next entry stays open.
# BUG: the completed entry leaves the view, editing ends, and the typed x completes the next entry instead
file <<END
- Aa @due({today-2})
- Bb @due({today-1})
END
keys gO <Enter> /
type comp
keys <Enter>
type x
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Aax @due({today-2}) @done({today})
- Bb @due({today-1})
END
